WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:03.620
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.350
Altergeist Meluseek attacks you directly!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.360
Ectoplaster!

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.790
Meluseek's additional effect!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:22.170
When it deals you battle damage, one card 
on your field goes to the graveyard!

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.770
Bye bye, Cyberse Wizard.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.280
This was why she brought out Meluseek.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.380
The remaining monsters 
have a total of 3700 ATK.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.270
This is bad, Playmaker!

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.880
You're already in a pinch!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.350
Battle!

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:42.320
Altergeist Marionetter 
attacks Playmaker directly!

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.600
It's over.  Prepare yourself!

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.170
Don't lose, Playmaker!

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.840
My fate is at stake!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:20.690
I run Across the universe

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.860
At the speed of light

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.730
Begin Loading

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:29.460
Open the door of dreams

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.030
VRAINS spreads

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.140
Believe in myself

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:39.670
VRAINS continues

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.980
The circuit draws the future

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.050
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:50.650
Access!

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:53.350
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.960
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.260
Link with my soul

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.030
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.760
Now Win the Race

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:04.600
Connected world

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:08.100
No matter when

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.470
Nothing is impossible

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.610
Strive for hope

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:20.180
And ride the wind!

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:45.340
Hey!  Shape up!

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.080
Or else, the direct attack 
will erase all your LP!

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.050
Yamamoto!

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.680
Unbelievable!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.340
Will LINK VRAINS's hero finally lose today?

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.000
This isn't the time for that!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.490
If we don't get this big 
scoop, we'll be fired!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.600
That's true, but you're heartless!

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.970
And you call yourself a duelist?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.970
No, I'm just a cameraman.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:14.140
I just don't want you to 
lose your directing job.

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.180
You care about me that much?

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:23.150
Of course!  I respect you 
as my boss, Yamamoto-

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:31.130
- Thanks!  I'm so touched! 
- Can't breathe...

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:44.750
Battle!

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.240
Altergeist Primebanshee attacks you directly!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.250
We're done for!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:03:59.620
Peek.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:02.620
When your monster attacks me directly...

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:06.930
...I can Special Summon Lockout Gardna 
from my hand in attack position!

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:16.300
By Special Summoning it, it can't 
be destroyed in battle this turn.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:22.040
If Primebanshee attacks Lockout Gardna...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.510
We'll be down to 800 LP.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:33.490
But if that happens, we 
can activate Storm Access.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.720
This is bad, Playmaker!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:40.260
We won't lose all our LP, 
but we'll lose most of it!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.300
This is bad!  Super bad!  It's all over!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.860
Oh, Playmaker!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.970
- What's with that AI's horrible acting job?
- I know you'll be sad when I'm gone!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:53.170
When Playmaker has less than 1000 
LP, he can activate his Skill.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:57.510
He thinks that horrible acting 
will get me to attack?

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:00.950
I won't battle!  I end my turn!

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:03.020
What?  Why?

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.420
After I tried so hard?

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.890
Your acting job stunk.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.020
Sniff...  Sniff...

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.220
No way!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.830
Why did Ghost Girl stop her attack?

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:22.180
So that Playmaker couldn't use his Skill.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.200
I see.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.070
Phew.  He's safe for now.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:27.180
You're fine with that?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:32.450
To create the TV special, you need 
Playmaker to lose and get the scoop!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:37.740
Oh yeah!  Why should I care about Playmaker?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:43.420
As a reporter, I must remain objective!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.640
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:09.710
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Altergeist Protocol!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:18.660
I tribute Meluseek to activate 
Altergeist Primebanshee's effect!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.510
I Special Summon an Altergeist 
from my deck next to its link.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:27.930
I Special Summon Altergeist 
Silquitous in defense position!

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:35.440
When Meluseek is sent to the graveyard, I 
add one Altergeist in my deck to my hand.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:39.640
I add Altergeist Kunquery to my hand!

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.380
As I expected.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:45.620
Kunquery's effect can 
negate a monster's attack.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.490
She got a problematic card.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:51.460
But I can't let up.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:55.080
When only your monster is 
in the Extra Monster Zone...

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:58.330
...I can Special Summon 
Backlinker from my hand!

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.860
I tribute Backlinker to activate its effect!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.710
All monsters in the Extra Monster 
Zone are sent to the graveyard.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.040
Good!  Well done!

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.010
I won't allow that!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:19.320
I send Marionetter to the graveyard to 
activate Altergeist Protocol's effect!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:23.030
Your monster's effect is negated!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:27.530
How's that?  I've anticipated 
all your strategies.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.190
She's tough.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:36.230
When your monster's effect 
negates my Cyberse's effect...

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:40.710
...I can Special Summon 
Striping Partner from my hand!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.940
When Striping Partner is Special Summoned...

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:53.620
...I can Special Summon a Level 4 
or lower Cyberse from my graveyard.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:56.320
Resurrect, Backlinker!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:02.560
If you're resurrecting Backlinker to send 
Primebanshee to the graveyard, I won't let you.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:09.030
I return Altergeist Protocol to my hand to 
activate Altergeist Silquitous's effect!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.770
Striping Partner returns to your hand!

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.510
Lockout Gardna's effect activates!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.820
When your monster's effect 
targets my Cyberse...

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:25.680
...your monster and my Cyberse's 
effects are negated.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:33.630
So Striping Partner and Altergeist 
Silquitous's effects are negated.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:38.100
Therefore, Striping Partner 
doesn't return to my hand.

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:44.120
You saved your Primebanshee.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:48.040
But you left him with 
monsters to Link Summon.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:55.760
But I still have...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.000
What's with this duel?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.250
It's so complex that I'm dizzy!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.300
What are you talking about?

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.600
They're outmaneuvering each other.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.360
Experts would love this duel!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.360
I can't predict the outcome.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:17.440
Yusaku and Ghost Girl's 
duel is beyond average.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:33.750
Playmaker is interesting, as I expected.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:40.060
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.940
The summoning conditions 
are two Effect Monsters.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:51.440
I set Lockout Gardna and Striping Partner!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.570
Link Summon!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.710
Appear, Link 2 Underclock Taker!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.930
And I summon Balancer Lord!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.920
Underclock Taker's effect!

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.890
Balancer Lord is linked to it...

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:20.920
...so its 1700 ATK are subtracted 
from Primebanshee's ATK.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.030
I won't let you!

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:27.140
I activate the trap card, 
Altergeist Camouflage!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:29.740
I equip it on Primebanshee!

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:36.650
It negates Underclock Taker's 
effect against Primebanshee!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.390
Aww!  Underclock Taker's effect was negated.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:46.650
Due to Camouflage's additional 
effect, you can't attack my monster.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:49.390
Now I've completely protected Primebanshee.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:55.040
You are interesting, but 
you've reached your limit.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:04.140
You are interesting, but 
you've reached your limit.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.010
Are you sure?

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:11.880
I pay 1000 LP to activate 
Balancer Lord's effect!

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.230
Playmaker has 900 LP.

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.410
He can now activate his Skill.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.490
I won't let him activate Storm Access!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.370
And he's the not the only 
one who can use Skills!

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.960
I activate the Skill, Secret Cure!

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.290
What?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.270
What's her Skill?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.940
I flip over cards in my 
deck until I get a monster.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.250
I add that monster to my hand.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:47.750
And we both gain LP equal 
to that monster's ATK.

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.930
The first card.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:57.900
I send Altergeist Camouflage 
to the graveyard.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.950
The second card.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.220
Altergeist Meluseek!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.140
I add it to my hand.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:09.720
We both gain LP equal to Meluseek's ATK.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:19.070
Meluseek punished us before, so 
it's bad that she got that card.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.350
I don't like giving up.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.840
I still have Balancer Lord's effect.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:31.330
In addition to my usual summon this 
turn, I can summon one Cyverse monster.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.790
I summon Scan Doll!

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:43.760
When Scan Doll is summoned, I can 
pay 1000 LP to activate its effect!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.180
Playmaker has 400 LP.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:53.320
From your graveyard, I use Altergeist 
Camouflage's effect on Silquitous.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.050
What for?

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:59.520
He'll use your own Camouflage's 
effect against you.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:03.490
He forgot that I have Kunquery in my hand.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:11.800
Good!  You can now activate Storm Access!

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.270
Playmaker, draw a comeback card!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:37.870
It's powerful!

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.240
Yamamoto!  This is...

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:48.210
This Data Storm is savage!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.770
Go!  Get a close-up!

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:20.510
If we get any closer, the 
wind will drag us in!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.980
I don't care!  Go!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.940
Aye aye, sir!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:29.090
Hurry!  You're too slow!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.230
I'm trying my best!

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:35.000
Where did they go?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.990
I can't see them anymore!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.270
What's with all this data?

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.370
What a powerful Data Storm!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.000
Playmaker!  Activate your Skill!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.700
I couldn't stop him from 
activating his Skill!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.410
Storm Access!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.490
I've lost control!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.260
Hey, what are you doing?

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.360
I'm saving Ghost Girl.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.340
We'll be swallowed up too!

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:35.780
Playmaker?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:41.950
Seems you're okay.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.280
The duel isn't over yet.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:14.120
You're like a superhero, Playmaker.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.590
Yamamoto, over there!

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.010
They've come out!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.460
They're both okay.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.430
Thank you.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:28.900
But that had nothing to do with this duel.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.060
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.370
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.840
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.310
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Cyberse monsters!

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:49.320
I set Link 2 Underclock Taker and 
Balancer Lord in the Link Markers!

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:57.540
Link Summon!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.470
Appear, Link 3!

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:03.200
Excode Talker!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:17.650
Even if you want to attack 
me directly, I have Kunquery.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.820
I won't let you attack me directly!

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.790
Excode Talker's effect activates!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.520
Grasp Zone!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.680
For every monster in the 
Extra Monster Zone...

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:30.800
...you can't use a space 
in your Main Monster Zone!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.500
No way!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.070
There are two monsters in 
the Extra Monster Zone.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.970
And there are two open spaces 
in your Main Monster Zone!

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:44.580
So your two Main Monster 
Zone spaces are sealed!

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:51.180
I can't use Kunquery's effect if 
there's no room to Special Summon.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.190
There are two monsters on my field.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:58.620
But due to Camouflage's effect, 
they can't be attacked.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:02.090
I tribute Scan Doll to activate its effect!

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:06.600
Excode Talker is allowed to attack twice!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:13.470
He's gone beyond my expectations!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.710
Excode Talker attacks you directly!

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.620
It's over.  Prepare yourself.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.620
Then I attack you directly!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.360
Excode Close!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.280
I completely lost.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.880
He did it!

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:50.240
Playmaker truly is LINK VRAINS's hero!

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.620
Why are you celebrating?

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:58.410
Our hero's first defeat 
would've been a huge scoop.

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:02.920
Sheesh.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:07.740
If it wasn't for me, who 
knows what would've happened.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.290
That was stressful.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.230
The moon is pretty tonight.

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:18.470
Really?  It looks like data to me.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:22.860
A dumb AI can't understand this feeling.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:23.840
You promised.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.540
Give us what you promised.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:27.960
Of course.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:44.910
You now have the backdoor to 
SOL Technologies' data bank.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.530
Until next time.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.270
It's going to get interesting.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:01.950
Hey, what's in SOL Technologies' data bank?

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.950
I don't know.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:06.650
However...

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:16.560
There may be something 
about myself ten years ago.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.320
What?  It has that?

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.900
Is that important data?

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:23.570
Hey!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.290
Well?  Did you film it?

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:29.010
Of course!  Perfectly!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:36.250
We didn't get a scoop on Playmaker's 
historical defeat, but we did film a fantastic duel!

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:40.260
We can finish the Playmaker TV special!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.560
Yeah!  Play back the duel!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:44.650
Okay!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.500
Huh?

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.160
What's up?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.040
Something's wrong.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:01.380
Sorry, but I erased your recording.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.850
What should we do, Yamamoto?

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.460
Don't say my real name!

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.900
Yamamoto!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:20.520
Sorry, but tonight's duel is a 
secret between me and Playmaker.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:31.750
Kusanagi.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.170
Thank you.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.910
Can you analyze it?

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:37.040
Yeah.

00:21:37.260 --> 00:21:38.600
I'm counting on you.

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.450
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:28.990
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:32.590
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:36.630
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:40.550
Try It over and over

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:48.710
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:55.650
The timeline flows forever

00:22:55.940 --> 00:22:58.210
Nothing is certain

00:22:58.340 --> 00:22:59.890
In these isolated times

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:01.620
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.390
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:06.810
The traces we leave behind

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:10.380
The traces we leave behind

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:14.350
The miracles we create

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:16.590
Never Give Up Never!

00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:20.400
